  "full_text": "Trigonite Innovations is an early stage DTEK company building the connective tissue physical AI for visual capture. We combine motion capture data, reinforcement learning, and VR validation to train autonomous camera policies, software cinematographers that learn from data and deploy to real hardware. Our current focus is dance performance and live event cinematography. We work with mock up libraries, train custom policies, and deliver them in formats that drop into both creative pipelines and drone hardware.",
